      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Fungal Forest [zone=712]\n**Who:**\n- Deagus the Fungrotect [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Potent Vitamolid Spores [item=86871]\n- Primnitane Spores [item=86617]\n- Treated Potent Vitamolid Spores [item=86876]\n- Xanthiune Spores [item=86862]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Rakkirin Shrivstem [npc=34877]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Fate of the Telmira [quest=4996]\n- Gathering of Essentials [quest=4997]\n- Seeds for the Waterstalkers [quest=4998]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jan 5 19:11:44 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This shared task (1-6 players) begins with Deagus the Fungrotect in the Fungal Forest. He is located at about 1305, 655, 255 (north-central area). Watch out for roaming KOS mobs while speaking with him._\n_In order to request this task, you must have completed \"Fate of the Telmira\", \"Gathering of Essentials\", and \"Seeds For the Waterstalkers\"._\nYou say, 'Hail, Deagus the Fungrotect'\nDeagus the Fungrotect says 'Hello! Perhaps you can help me. The entire blasted forest has gone [mad]!'\nYou say, 'Mad?'\nDeagus the Fungrotect says 'Cliknar are invading thinking they own the place, and the [Shrivstem] sporali are on the warpath. The emissaries of the Faith of Self came and influenced them to conquer the Fungal Forest. It's bad enough that I have to deal with these blasted rhino [beetles] keeping me up at night.'\nYou say, 'What about these Shrivstem?'\nDeagus the Fungrotect says 'In sporali culture, the Shrivstems were the most beloved of Brell. Now they have descended into darkness, killing and hunting the other creatures of the Forest, performing strange rituals, and staining their own reputation. The Faith of Self influenced them with some sort of false belief that their wants are greater than the needs of the community; now they are up to no good. Their leader, Rakkirin, seems to have gone insane. He has taken Vaelani hostage, using a magic bottle to reduce her to a stored glowing essence. We must guarantee her [safety].'\nYou say, 'How do we guarantee safety?'\nDeagus the Fungrotect says 'You must go and talk with Rakkirin, negotiate, and find out what it is that he will want in exchange for freeing Vaelani. Will you [do] this?'\nYou say, 'I will do this'\n_Without pre-requisites:_\nDeagus the Fungrotect says 'There are a lot of complicated issues to deal with these days. I don't fully understand what's happening, and I don't think you do either. So perhaps you can help clear things up. Speak with Orgus Shrivstem, Adeenas and Excrug Shrivstem, if you haven't already. They can use your help, and what we learn from them could make sense of things. If you can do that, then I might have a task for you.'\n_With pre-requsites:_\nDeagus the Fungrotect says 'Excellent. My job just got a lot easier. With your help, we can put this place back together. Speak with Rakkirin, find out what he wants, then high-tail it back here and we'll put our heads together to see if there's a way we can deceive him and get Vaelani back at the same time.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Salvation of Spores'\n\n---\n\nNegotiate with Rakkirin for the release of Vaelani 0/1 (Fungal Forest)\n_Rakkirin Shrivstem is found in the southeastern-most part of the zone surrounded by KOS sporali mobs._\nSpeak with Deagus the Fungrotect before helping Rakkirin (Fungal Forest)\nCollect some Xanthiune Spores from motile and vigorous earths 0/4 (Fungal Forest)\nCollect some Primnitane Spores from motile and vigorous mosses 0/3 (Fungal Forest)\nCollect some Potent Vitamolid Spores from motile and vigorous spore slimes 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\n_Xanthiune Spores drop from \"vigorous earth\" and \"motile earth\" oozes. Primnitane Spores drop from \"a motile moss\" and \"a vigorous moss\". Potent Vitamolid Spores drop from \"vigorous spore slime\" and \"motile spore slime\"._\nBring the vitamolid spores to Deagus the Fungrotect 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\nSpeak with Deagus the Fungrotect 0/1 (Fungal Forest)\nDeliver the Xanthiune Spores to Rakkirin Shrivstem 0/4 (Fungal Forest)\nDeliver the Primnitane Spores to Rakkirin Shrivstem 0/3 (Fungal Forest)\nDeliver the Treated Potent Vitamolid Spores to Rakkirin Shrivstem 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\nSpeak with Rakkirin Shrivstem 0/1 (Fungal Forest)\nReturn the bottle with Vaelani's essence to Deagus the Fungrotect 0/1 (Fungal Forest)\nDeagus the Fungrotect says 'Let's see, a typical magic bottle, and I must release the telmira trapped inside with some Dwarven panache! Stand back as I open it. Ah, Vaelani is free now! It might take a while for his essence to coalesce and become physical, but at least it now has a chance, free from Rakkirin's control.'\nYou have successfully tricked Rakkirin Shrivstem into releasing Vaelani, while preventing him from acquiring the spores he needed to create mutated sporali.\n_Rewards:_\n105 platinum\nExperience (1.1 AAs at Level 85)\n20 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
