      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Fungal Forest [zone=712]\n**Who:**\n- Orgus Shrivstem [npc=34828]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 85\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Doublejointed Beetle Jaw [item=86856]\n- Gelatinous Osmopump [item=86782]\n- Lump of Cliknar Brainwax [item=87136]\n- Mass of Rancid Spider Palp [item=86855]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Adeenas [ _Quest, Mission_]\n**Era:** | !Underfoot\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Jan 5 19:11:38 2010\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | _This solo task begins with Orgus Shrivstem at approximate location 255, 2675, 340 in the Fungal Forest (just outside Pellucid Grotto)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Orgus Shrivstem'\nOrgus Shrivstem says 'Hello. If you would not harm me, and help me gather some additional [materials], I will agree to do you a service.'\nYou say, 'Tell me about these materials'\nOrgus Shrivstem says 'Yes, sadly I was expelled from my tribe, and that is a difficult situation to be in. We sporali cling to the most amenable areas of the Fungal Forest, and when I was driven away, I had little choice but to move to a less hospitable area. There is much that I need to survive. It is much drier here; I will need a sealant like cliknar brainwax to survive for long. I will also need to create a pouch from a gelatinous osmopump so that I can brew the yeast I need to season the spider palps for my dinner. I can probably catch my own [spiders] later, if I had a set of beetle jaws that would be suitable for a deadfall trap. There is much I can tell you in exchange for this [help]. In addition, if you could contact Adeenas, and tell him of my plight, I would be very grateful.'\nYou say, 'What'll you give me for my help?'\nOrgus Shrivstem says 'Help me with this effort, and I will do what I can to reward you with knowledge.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Gathering of Essentials'.\nOrgus Shrivstem has left his tribe of sporali, fearing that they are acting against the will of Brell. He can be a good source of background information for the Fungal Forest, but first he will need some help gathering supplies he needs to survive.\nLoot some masses of rancid spider palp from spiders in the Fungal Forest. Orgus will feed on these. Get a lump of cliknar brainwax. Orgus needs this to keep his outer body from drying out. Harvest of gelatinous osmopump from the body of a goo. Orgus can fashion this into a yeast-growing sac. Bring Orgus a double-jointed beetle jaw. He needs this element to construct a small animal trap. Bring Orgus' plea for assistance to Adeenas of the Telmira.\n\n---\n\nCollect 2 Rancid Spider Palps from spiders 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\n_These can drop from all spiders in Fungal Forest._\nCollect 1 Lump of Cliknar Brainwax from cliknar 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\n_These can drop from all cliknar in the zone._\nCollect 1 Gelatinous Osmopump from oozes 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\n_Known to drop from: a motile moss; a vigorous moss; motile earth; motile spore slime; vigorous spore slime._\nCollect 1 Double Jointed Beetle Jaw from rhino beetles 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\n_These drop from rhino beetles and large rhino beetles._\n_All items are pre-lootable and are fairly common drops from the given mobs._\nDeliver 2 Rancid Spider Palps to Orgus 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\nDeliver 1 Lump of Cliknar Brainwax to Orgus 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\nDeliver 1 Gelatinous Osmopump to Orgus 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\nDeliver 1 Double Jointed Beetle Jaw to Orgus 0/2 (Fungal Forest)\nSpeak with Adeenas 0/1 (Fungal Forest)\n_Adeenas is located in the southeastern area of the zone at approximately -905, -850, 95. Watch out for roaming KOS mobs at her location._\nYou say, 'Hail, Adeenas'\nYour task 'Gathering of Essentials' has been updated.\nAdeenas says 'You are quite an interesting creature! Too interesting to be ignored, of course. I am Adeenas of the telmira. I understand you bring greetings and supplications from Orgus Shrivstem. He worries much, but he is in a safe place and will endure for a long time, as long as he uses hit wits and invites no additional attention. Come back later, and I may have thought of a thing or two you can do for me, if you want. I have favors of my own that need asking.'\nReturn to Orgus 0/1 (Fungal Forest)\nYou say, 'Hail, Orgus Shrivstem'\nYou have successfully aided Orgus Shrivstem in his effort to stay alive in his state of exile. You have also learned more about the situation in the Fungal Forest, and what it might take to restore order here.\nOrgus Shrivstem says 'You are very kind to assist me. Not many would go out of their way for a talking sporali--certainly not many of the two-legged mammals. I made a promise to tell you about what has happened to the Fungal Forest. Proselytizers of the Church of Self came not long after we stopped feeling the magic presence of Brell Serilis. They convinced many among the sporali to change their ways and serve their own needs rather than those of the Underfoot. This seemed to me to be at odds with Brell's vision for a well-functioning Forest. Not long after that, Rakkirin took over as the leader of the tribe and began organizing us to destroy the others. Most wanted little to do with him, and nothing at all to do with any rebellion. I argued at first, but I was threatened with heresy and burning. The other tribes were decimated, and I saw that I must flee. Here I have been for several days, watching as the cliknar came. If chaos reigns here, all the worlds connected to this place will become infertile.'\n_Rewards:_\n105 platinum\nExperience (1.1 AAs at Level 85)\n20 Brellium Tokens\n- Brellium Token [item=88944]",
